---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';import {CONTACT_EMAIL,url,type Locale} from '../content/site';
const {locale,kind}=Astro.props as {locale:Locale;kind:'about'|'privacy'};const zh=locale==='zh';
const title=kind==='about'?(zh?'关于 DotsDashes':'About DotsDashes'):(zh?'隐私说明':'Privacy');
---
<Site locale={locale} title={`${title} | DotsDashes`} description={zh?'了解 DotsDashes 的工具、字符标准与隐私处理方式。':'Learn about DotsDashes tools, character standards and privacy practices.'} path={`${kind}/`}>
<article class="article"><h1>{title}</h1>
{kind==='about'?<>
<p>{zh?'DotsDashes 从摩斯密码工具开始，帮助你把文字变成点划、把点划读成文字，并听到或保存信号的声音。我们希望工具在手机上也能直接、清楚地使用。':'DotsDashes starts with Morse code tools: turn text into dots and dashes, read a written signal, and listen to or save its sound. Our aim is to make these tasks straightforward on a phone as well as a desktop.'}</p>
<h2>{zh?'工具与范围':'Tools and scope'}</h2><p>{zh?'当前提供摩斯密码翻译器、可试听对照表和 WAV 音频生成器。支持范围在各工具中明确列出；汉字、录音识别与全部程序信号不在当前支持范围内。':'The current tools are a Morse code translator, an audible alphabet chart and a WAV audio generator. Each tool states its supported characters and limits. Chinese characters, recording transcription and the full set of procedural signals are not currently supported.'}</p>
<h2>{zh?'标准与校验':'Standards and verification'}</h2><p>{zh?'字符与标准间隔参考 ITU-R M.1677-1。转换、试听和导出共享映射与时序，遇到不支持的内容会明确提示。工具适用于学习与创作，不是应急通讯设备。':'Mappings and standard spacing are based on ITU-R M.1677-1. Conversion, playback and export share the same mappings and timing. Unsupported input is reported explicitly. These tools are intended for learning and creative work, not emergency communication.'}</p>
<h2>{zh?'联系我们':'Contact us'}</h2><p>{zh?'如果发现字符错误、声音问题或手机上的操作障碍，欢迎发邮件联系我们。请说明浏览器、设备和复现步骤，避免附上敏感内容。':'For an incorrect character, audio problem or mobile usability issue, email us with your browser, device and steps to reproduce. Please avoid including sensitive content.'} <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></p>
</>:<>
<p>{zh?'本说明适用于 dotsdashes.com 的当前工具版本。更新日期：2026 年 10 月 21 日。':'This notice describes the current tools on dotsdashes.com. Updated October 21, 2026.'}</p>
<h2>{zh?'输入与音频':'Your input and audio'}</h2><p>{zh?'文字转换、音频播放与 WAV 文件生成在当前浏览器中完成。工具不会把输入、输出或生成的音频上传到我们的服务器，也不将这些内容保存到 Cookie 或浏览器本地存储。刷新页面或切换语言可能清空输入；复制或下载的内容由你的设备和相关应用管理。':'Text conversion, audio playback and WAV generation happen in your browser. The tools do not upload input, output or generated audio to our server, or store those contents in cookies or browser storage. Reloading or changing language may clear your message. Content you copy or download is managed by your device and the apps you use.'}</p>
<h2>{zh?'网站访问与托管':'Website requests and hosting'}</h2><p>{zh?'网页由 Cloudflare 托管。加载网站仍会向托管服务发送必要的网络请求，其中可能包含 IP 地址、请求路径和浏览器信息，用于提供网站、安全防护及运行诊断。工具不会把输入内容拼接到网址中。':'Cloudflare hosts this website. Loading pages still sends network requests to the hosting service, which may include your IP address, requested path and browser information for delivery, security and operational diagnostics. The tools do not place your message in page URLs.'} <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare {zh?'隐私政策':'privacy policy'} ↗</a></p>
<h2>{zh?'统计、广告与权限':'Analytics, advertising and permissions'}</h2><p>{zh?'仅在你选择“允许统计”后，我们才加载 Google Analytics，以 Cookie 统计页面访问和基本设备、来源信息，并记录复制、播放、音频文件生成等操作是否成功。操作事件只包含工具类型、动作类别和界面语言，不包含具体字符、设置值或错误原文。我们不向它发送工具输入、转换结果或音频；统计网址不包含查询参数或片段，来源仅保留域名。增强型衡量、广告个性化和 Google Signals 均关闭。可通过页脚的“统计偏好”拒绝或撤回；撤回会清理本站控制的 GA Cookie 并刷新页面，已收集的历史数据不会因此自动删除。浏览器本地只保存允许/拒绝偏好，不保存工具内容。Cloudflare 另外提供不使用分析 Cookie 的页面访问及加载性能统计。本站没有第三方广告或会话回放。工具不要求注册、麦克风或位置权限。复制功能可能由浏览器询问剪贴板权限；无法自动复制时，可手动选中结果。后续如改变数据处理方式，会更新本说明。':'Only after you choose “Allow analytics” do we load Google Analytics, which uses cookies to measure page visits and basic device and referral information, plus actions such as copying, playing audio and creating audio files. Action events contain only the tool, action category and interface language, never characters, settings values or error text. We do not send tool input, results or audio. Analytics page URLs exclude queries and fragments, and referrers are limited to their origin. Enhanced measurement, advertising personalization and Google Signals are disabled. Use “Analytics preferences” in the footer to reject or withdraw consent. Withdrawal clears the GA cookies we control and reloads the page; it does not automatically delete previously collected data. Browser storage holds only your allow/reject preference, not tool content. Cloudflare separately provides page-visit and loading-performance measurement without analytics cookies. We have no third-party advertising or session replay. No account, microphone or location permission is required. Your browser may request clipboard permission when you copy; manual selection remains available. This notice will be updated if data handling changes.'}</p>
<h2>{zh?'外部链接':'External links'}</h2><p>{zh?'标准来源和托管服务的隐私政策链接指向外部网站，适用各自的隐私规则。':'Links to standards references and the hosting provider’s privacy policy lead to external websites with their own privacy practices.'}</p>
<h2>{zh?'邮件联系':'Contact by email'}</h2><p>{zh?'如有隐私问题，请联系下方邮箱。主动发邮件时，你的邮箱地址和邮件内容会经邮件服务商传送给我们，用于处理你的请求；这与工具在浏览器本地进行的转换是分开的。请勿发送敏感文件或无需提供的个人信息。':'For privacy questions, contact us at the address below. When you email us, your email address and message are delivered through email providers so we can respond to your request. This is separate from the tools’ local processing. Please avoid sending sensitive files or unnecessary personal information.'} <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></p>
</>}
<a href={url(locale)}>{zh?'← 返回翻译器':'← Back to the translator'}</a></article>
</Site>
